          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;I wish everything would just stop. I wish I could stop imagining her blacked out in an alley somewhere. I wish I could forget, just for a little bit. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The universe grants my wish in the form of a truck, headlights, and shattered glass. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modern au- Adora loses her memory in a car accident, and Catra has to live with the guilt.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
